PairDesk's computer program (agent/), relay (relay/), protocol and Flutter
phone app (mobile/) are his work, and are used here under the GPL. This
repository is a standalone copy, not a live fork.

CHANGES BY LAPALU LIYANAGE
--------------------------
- Renamed every PairDesk identifier to PocketDesk on the phone and computer
  sides together (pocketdesk:// links, the _pocketdesk._tcp Bonjour type,
  pocketdesk/* channels, bundle id me.lapalu.pocketdesk, environment
  variables, HTTP headers, the sign-in handshake string, default relay
  relay.lapalu.me, the agent binary name, config and data folders), so a
  PairDesk phone and a PocketDesk computer cannot pair, or the other way round.
- Added the iPhone app: an iOS project for the Flutter app, a local iOS
  plugin (mobile/packages/pocketdesk_ios) for the files channel and pairing
  links, an unsigned .ipa build on GitHub Actions, and iPhone install notes.
- Mac-aware phone UI: a Mac icon, Cmd instead of Ctrl, and Mac default
  shortcut buttons.
- Settings > About credits, this NOTICE, and a CI check for leftover
  PairDesk names.

Further changes are recorded in the git history.
